  "description": "Pre-order: BRX orders ship starting December 1.\n\nYour city. Your pace. Your ride. The SWFT BRX is a step-through e-bike made for everyday rides: a 500W motor, 20 mph top speed, a removable 48V battery with up to 35 miles of range*, 26\" wheels with front suspension, and a rear rack and full fenders that come standard.\n\nStep through. Settle in.\nA low step-through frame makes it easy to get on and off in everyday clothes, and the padded saddle adjusts to your height. Fits riders from 5'2\" to 6'3\".\n\nSmooth power on every hill\nThe 500W rear hub motor, 4 pedal assist levels (9 / 12 / 16 / 20 mph), a throttle and 7-speed gears get you rolling with ease and take on hills up to 15°.\n\nUp to 35 miles on a removable battery*\nThe 48V 10.4Ah lithium-ion battery covers weekday commutes, errands and weekend rides. Charge it on or off the bike in 5–6 hours.\n\nReady for everyday errands\nA rear rack, full front and rear fenders and a kickstand come standard, so groceries, gym bags and rainy streets are covered.\n\nRide smooth on every street\n\n26\" wheels: roll easily over cracks and bumps\n\nSWFT Ride-Right Ready™\nUL 2849 certified and tested by an accredited lab, speed-limited within legal limits with no unlock modes, and clearly labeled with top speed, wattage and class. Every box includes a free teen e-bike safety course from Aceable. Learn more\n\n*Range depends on rider weight, terrain, assist level and temperature.",
